&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:start&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Saadet Partisi Genel Başkanı Mahmut Arıkan, partisinin&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#0f1419&quot;&gt;Konya Merkez İl&amp;ccedil;eler Kongresinde konuştu. &amp;ldquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Konya&amp;rsquo;daki Fatma ablam, pazarda bir kilo sebze alırken fiyatından utanıp başını &amp;ouml;ne eğiyor, Ankara&amp;rsquo;daki Fatma abla, adliye koridorlarında g&amp;uuml;lerek fon ifadesi veriyor!&amp;rdquo; diyen Arıkan, saklanan fon vurguncuları listesi &amp;uuml;zerinden iktidara y&amp;uuml;klendi. &amp;ldquo;Bu Kir Ancak sandıkta Aklanır&amp;rdquo; diyen Saadet Partisi Genel Başkanı erken se&amp;ccedil;im &amp;ccedil;ağrısı yaptı.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:start&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Mahmut Arıkan&amp;rsquo;ın konuşmasında &amp;ouml;ne &amp;ccedil;ıkan başlıklar şu şekilde;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:start&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;BİR YANDA KARA KARA D&amp;Uuml;Ş&amp;Uuml;NENLER, DİĞER YANDA G&amp;Uuml;LEREK VERİLEN FON İFADELERİ&amp;rdquo;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:start&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Konyalı &amp;ccedil;ift&amp;ccedil;i Hasan abim, toprağını ekebilmek i&amp;ccedil;in trakt&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;ne mazot alamazken; birileri, kurdukları fon vurgunlarıyla, bir gecede trilyonlar g&amp;ouml;t&amp;uuml;r&amp;uuml;yor! Konya&amp;#39;da &amp;uuml;niversitede okuyan Mehmet kardeşim, bir kafede bir kahve i&amp;ccedil;mek i&amp;ccedil;in kara kara d&amp;uuml;ş&amp;uuml;nmek zorunda kalırken; Ankara&amp;rsquo;da birileri masa başında kurdukları kirli &amp;ccedil;arkla bu gen&amp;ccedil;liğin geleceğini &amp;ccedil;alıyor! Daha a&amp;ccedil;ık konuşayım; Konya&amp;rsquo;daki Fatma ablam, pazarda bir kilo sebze alırken fiyatından utanıp başını &amp;ouml;ne eğiyor, Ankara&amp;rsquo;daki Fatma abla, adliye koridorlarında g&amp;uuml;lerek fon ifadesi veriyor!&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:start&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;KASIRGA SİYASİ AYAKTA KOPARKEN DAHA NE KADAR B&amp;Uuml;ROKRATLAR &amp;Uuml;ZERİNDEN ALGI KOVALAYACAKSINIZ?&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:start&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;Fon vurgunu, Cumhurbaşkanlığı H&amp;uuml;k&amp;uuml;met Sistemi krizidir. &amp;ldquo;Kararlar hızlanacak&amp;rdquo; diyerek y&amp;uuml;r&amp;uuml;tme yetkisini tek elde topladınız.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:start&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Aradan 52 g&amp;uuml;n ge&amp;ccedil;ti, h&amp;acirc;l&amp;acirc; &amp;ldquo;fon listelerini&amp;rdquo; bile a&amp;ccedil;ıklayamadınız! Bu iktidar, SPK&amp;rsquo;ya operasyon yaptı. Bu iktidar, MKK&amp;rsquo;ya, operasyon yaptı. Bu iktidar, BDDK&amp;rsquo;ya operasyon yaptı. Peki; Bu iktidar, AKP&amp;rsquo;ye ne zaman neşter vuracak?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:start&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bu iktidar, AKP&amp;rsquo;ye ne zaman operasyon yapacak? Liste orada!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:start&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;AK Parti Genel Başkanının makam odasında, masanın &amp;uuml;zerinde duruyor, neymiş listede &amp;ccedil;ok g&amp;uuml;vendikleri isimler varmış &amp;ccedil;ok &amp;uuml;zg&amp;uuml;nlermiş! Aziz milletimizden daha hızlı olacağız diye aldığınız yetkiyi ne zaman kullanacaksınız? Kasırga &amp;ldquo;siyasi ayakta&amp;rdquo; koparken daha ne kadar b&amp;uuml;rokratlar &amp;uuml;zerinden algı kovalayacaksınız?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:start&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:start&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;BU KİR ANCAK SANDIKTA AKLANIR&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:start&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:start&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;Bu sistem &amp;ccedil;&amp;uuml;r&amp;uuml;m&amp;uuml;şt&amp;uuml;r, bu sistem vurguncular &amp;uuml;reten, onlardan da hesap dahi soramayan bir sistem haline gelmiştir.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:start&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Sayın Cumhurbaşkanı, tahmin edemeyeceğimiz kişiler var diye a&amp;ccedil;ıklama yapıyor. Liste &amp;ouml;n&amp;uuml;n&amp;uuml;zde duruyor, tahmine gerek yok. A&amp;ccedil;ıklayın o halde listeleri.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:start&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Listede; 60 AK Partili vekil, 180 yargı &amp;uuml;yesi, 30 vali ve kaymakam olduğu s&amp;ouml;yleniyor.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:start&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bu listeyi a&amp;ccedil;ıklamadığınız s&amp;uuml;rece; bu &amp;uuml;lkemize layıkıyla hizmet eden pırıl pırıl b&amp;uuml;rokratlarımızı, yargı &amp;uuml;yelerimizi, gece g&amp;uuml;nd&amp;uuml;z &amp;ccedil;alışan milletvekillerimizi, zan altında bırakıyorsunuz...&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:start&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Biz 25 yıldır iktidarı &amp;ccedil;ok iyi tanıdık, 50 g&amp;uuml;nd&amp;uuml;r listeyi a&amp;ccedil;ıklayamayan, ipin ucunun nereye gideceğini tahmin edemeyen bu iktidar, listeyi a&amp;ccedil;ıklayamaz. Peki bu liste nasıl a&amp;ccedil;ıklanacak? Konya&amp;rsquo;dan ilan ediyorum; Bu kir ancak sandıkta aklanır, bu liste ancak saadet partisi iktidarında a&amp;ccedil;ıklanır.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:start&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:start&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;ERKEN SE&amp;Ccedil;İMİN &amp;Ouml;N&amp;Uuml;N&amp;Uuml; A&amp;Ccedil;IN&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:start&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:start&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;İktidar danışman &amp;uuml;zerinden nabız yoklamayı bıraksın. Yeni yıla erken se&amp;ccedil;imle girmenin &amp;ouml;n&amp;uuml;n&amp;uuml; a&amp;ccedil;sın. Bunu danışmanlarla, atanmışlarla değil; Gazi Meclisimizle yapsın.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:start&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bizler bir&amp;ccedil;ok kez s&amp;ouml;yledik; Erken se&amp;ccedil;ime de hazırız, baskın se&amp;ccedil;ime de hazırız. Şimdi de s&amp;ouml;yl&amp;uuml;yoruz; Ocak&amp;rsquo;ta yapılacak se&amp;ccedil;ime de hazırız, Şubat&amp;#39;ta yapılacak se&amp;ccedil;ime de hazırız, kadrolarımız da hazır, aziz milletimiz de hazır. Hodri meydan; yolsuzluk listelerini a&amp;ccedil;ıklayamayanlar, se&amp;ccedil;men listelerini a&amp;ccedil;ıklasın; milletimiz sandıkta en g&amp;uuml;zel cevabı versin.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
